10 20 30 40 50 60 70 80 90 
Using for-each loop:
10 20 30 40 50 60 70 80 90 
Using while loop:
10 20 30 40 50 60 70 80 90 
Using Java 8's stream API:
10 20 30 40 50 60 70 80 90 
```

